WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.255
My identity is not my obstacle.

00:00:03.077 --> 00:00:05.284
My&nbsp;identity is my superpower.

00:00:05.284 --> 00:00:08.171
I am just one of 
millions of people

00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:11.714
who have been&nbsp;told that in 
order to fulfill my dreams,

00:00:12.313 --> 00:00:14.494
in order to contribute 
my talents to the world

00:00:14.494 --> 00:00:17.701
I&nbsp;have to resist the 
truth of who I am.

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:20.617
I for one, am ready 
to stop resisting

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:26.218
and to start existing&nbsp;as
 my full and authentic self.

00:00:26.218 --> 00:00:29.278
In spite of what I had 
been told my whole life,

00:00:29.811 --> 00:00:34.000
I saw firsthand&nbsp;that my 
unrealistic expectations

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.077
to see myself authentically 
represented in the culture

00:00:38.077 --> 00:00:40.390
were&nbsp;other people’s 
expectations, too.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:45.366
Collectively, we are what 
the world actually looks like.

00:00:45.366 --> 00:00:48.488
And in order for our 
systems to reflect that,

00:00:48.488 --> 00:00:51.379
they don't have to 
create a new reality.

00:00:51.379 --> 00:00:53.056
They just&nbsp;have to 
stop resisting

00:00:53.056 --> 00:00:55.397
the one we already live in.

